  "explain": {
   "ko": "아픈 곳은 me duele + 단수 명사, me duelen + 복수 명사로 말합니다(gustar와 같은 구조). 증상은 tengo + 명사로 표현합니다: Tengo fiebre.",
   "en": "Say where it hurts with me duele + singular noun, me duelen + plural noun (the same structure as gustar). Name symptoms with tengo + noun: Tengo fiebre."
  },
